    <li>questDescription(pilgrimCount&gt;=2,childCount&gt;=2,allChildren==false,priority=1)-&gt;ﻝﺎﻔﻃﻷﺍ ﺾﻌﺑ ﻢﻬﻨﻴﺑ [pilgrimsLabelSingularOrPlural] ﻦﻣ ﺔﻋﻮﻤﺠﻣ\n.[relic_name] ﺲﻳﺪﻘﺘﻟ ﺖﻠﺻﻭ ﺪﻗ\n\nﻦﻴﻣﺮﺘﺤﻣﻭ ﻦﻴﻨﻣﺁ [pronounSingularOrPlural] [isAre] ﻥﺃ ﻦﻤﻀﺗ ﺍﺫﺇ\nﺪﻘﻓ ،ﻢﻳﺪﻘﻟﺍ ﺮﺛﻷﺍ [visitSingularOrPlural] [pronounSingularOrPlural] ﺀﺎﻨﺛﺃ\n.ﺓﺄﻓﺎﻜﻣ ﻚﻟ ﻥﻮﻣﺪﻘﻳ</li>
    <li>questDescription(pilgrimCount&gt;=2,allChildren==true,priority=1)-&gt;ﺖﻠﺻﻭ ﺪﻗ [pilgrimsLabelSingularOrPlural] ﻝﺎﻔﻃﻷﺍ ﻦﻣ ﺔﻋﻮﻤﺠﻣ\n.[relic_name] ﺲﻳﺪﻘﺘﻟ\n\nﻦﻴﻣﺮﺘﺤﻣﻭ ﻦﻴﻨﻣﺁ [pronounSingularOrPlural] [isAre] ﻥﺃ ﻦﻤﻀﺗ ﺍﺫﺇ\nﺪﻘﻓ ،ﻢﻳﺪﻘﻟﺍ ﺮﺛﻷﺍ [visitSingularOrPlural] [pronounSingularOrPlural] ﺀﺎﻨﺛﺃ\n.ﺓﺄﻓﺎﻜﻣ ﻚﻟ ﻥﻮﻣﺪﻘﻳ</li>
    <li>isAre(pilgrimCount==1)-&gt;ﻥﻮﻜﻳ</li>
    <li>isAre(pilgrimCount&gt;=2)-&gt;ﺍﻮﻧﻮﻜﻳ</li>
    <li>pronounSingularOrPlural(pilgrimCount==1)-&gt;[pawns0_pronoun]</li>
    <li>pronounSingularOrPlural(pilgrimCount&gt;=2)-&gt;ﻢﻫ</li>
    <li>visitSingularOrPlural(pilgrimCount==1)-&gt;ﺭﻭﺰﻳ</li>
    <li>visitSingularOrPlural(pilgrimCount&gt;=2)-&gt;ﻥﻭﺭﻭﺰﻳ</li>
 </ReliquaryPilgrims.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
